Root cause:
The root cause of the bug was a compile error in the `dr_using_console` function due to the use of an uninitialized variable `DeviceInformation`. The variable was declared but not used correctly, leading to a mismatch in the expected type and causing the Visual Studio 2010 build to fail. The patch corrected this by properly declaring and using a new variable `device_info` instead, ensuring that the function compiles successfully.
